The shipped binaries (the native builds and the web build) contain the
following third-party software. It lists what is linked in, not what
sigil.lock resolves: the lock names every package the toolchain can
reach, and some are never linked. sigil-sqlite is the example (no sqlite
symbol appears in either binary), so it is not listed here.

Each entry names the library, its licence, the copyright holders as
their own files state them, and where it enters the build. The licence
texts are in the named dependencies' checkouts (sigil deps install fetches them; the paths are relative to
each dependency's root).

